// prompt: true when this image server was started with `--kernel-image` as argv[2]: its served image is the trusted kernel image
// (checkedUnit holds only the probe and FILE units). The default (no flag) checks every unit: forgetting the flag cannot turn
// checks off. A child process (--negt, --neg, --emit, --tests, --build) never has the flag at argv[2].
def Kernel.isKernelImage(): Bool = Args.count() >= 3 && Str.eq(Args.at(2), "--kernel-image")

